  <item>
    <title>EP9 穿过万物回到感受</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/682212ddb7c8a9962cbf8a6e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">682212ddb7c8a9962cbf8a6e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 May 2025 15:35:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>导语：我是谁？我怎么感受？思考这一切有什么意义？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a> 什么是感受？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="342">05:42</a> 觉察我们的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="904">15:04</a> 我们如何通过感受定位记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1195">19:55</a> 情绪和感受的背后</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1476">24:36</a> 当下的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1754">29:14</a> 自我觉察后的情绪接纳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2071">34:31</a> 主体性与自我认知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2702">45:02</a> 看山是山到看山是山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3003">50:03</a> 当下的我们</span></p>]]></description>
