  <item>
    <title>EP5 关于自我的左思右想｜在有限的人生视角中如何用“敏感”和“钝感”看到前路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66854155e387115434d3c24e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66854155e387115434d3c24e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jul 2024 12:17:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="162">02:42</a> 高敏感人就一定脆弱吗？高敏感人如何对待自己的情绪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a> 无法消解的情绪该安放何处？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="648">10:48</a> 人们变得更“敏感”还是“钝感”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="934">15:34</a> “发疯”是一种保护自己的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> “人生是旷野”，但“旷野”真的安全吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1092">18:12</a> 危机意识刺激人们走向何方？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1282">21:22</a> 主动敏感性和被动敏感性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> 敏感是一种天赋，顿感是一种能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 人们是否应该放弃敏感性奔向顿感力？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2048">34:08</a> “绩效社会”下人们的精神变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2294">38:14</a> 被动的“灵活性”激发了敏感者的攻击性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2455">40:55</a> 人格培养如何面对自我与社会？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2751">45:51</a> 学历与知识的割裂/工具性下敏感性的转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2990">49:50</a> 回归自我又不断成长的敏感与钝感</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lr32zIXTfRv7-a64pZW9CzDKLr1X.m4a" length="50466770" type="audio/mp4"/>
