    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP4 女性空间｜“走出”房间的她们该“出走”何方？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66683435b6a8412729f97a72</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66683435b6a8412729f97a72</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 11 Jun 2024 11:25:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a> 属于女性自己的房间代表了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="224">03:44</a> 女性的被动依赖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="471">07:51</a> 女性的“出走”始于“觉醒”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a> 婚姻：父权向夫权归属权的交接</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="909">15:09</a> 如今的评价体系更适合女性“出走”了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 婚姻、育儿与特定空间的绑定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1248">20:48</a> 女性可选择的空间被压缩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1448">24:08</a> 表象的“幸福生活”将人们困于压缩空间中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a> 对已婚女性与未婚女性的评价悖论，要么圣女要么荡妇？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2082">34:42</a> 要先“锁起来”，才能“放出来”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2301">38:21</a> 女性不能上桌吃饭从何而来？主体空间向男性的让位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2508">41:48</a> “留在牌桌上的女性”是接触社会的窗口</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2617">43:37</a> 谁给女性规定的KPI？</span></p>]]></description>
