    <guid isPermaLink="false">66456955251bd96e6ca5d4aa</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 May 2024 02:03:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“不爱吃也得吃”话语的背后逻辑？东亚家长的爱与权力，东亚家庭与社会的纠葛……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="163">02:43</a> &nbsp;孩子与父母的话语边界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> &nbsp;有些话选择不和父母说是逃避沟通的表现吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="514">08:34</a> &nbsp;社会判断对家庭结构的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="626">10:26</a> &nbsp;子女与父母间的时代错位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="782">13:02</a> &nbsp;东亚家庭中的权力矛盾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">16:25</a> &nbsp;被目的性加注的孩子是父母生活的延续</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> &nbsp;对人本身的忽视加剧家庭矛盾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1196">19:56</a> &nbsp;愧疚教育的实质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a> &nbsp;情感、核心家庭的双重缺失是代际沟通的隐患</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">25:22</a> &nbsp;年轻人对家庭角色和大家族的脱离</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1685">28:05</a> &nbsp;优绩主义在东亚家庭中的强势渗透</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1953">32:33</a> &nbsp;四种家庭主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2416">40:16</a> &nbsp;我们的家庭终将走向何方？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a> &nbsp;小彩蛋🎉</span></p>]]></description>
