  <item>
    <title>EP1 坠落的审判 | 语言何以审判女性？我们的语言如何被塑造？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662654dec3e09d8f37b7b9ab</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662654dec3e09d8f37b7b9ab</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 22 Apr 2024 12:15:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《坠落死亡的剖析》：正义从来与真相无关，但当孩子背出父亲的遗言时，这场审判将会永远持续……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:29</a> &nbsp;《坠落死亡的剖析》电影剧情介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="97">01:37</a> &nbsp;婚姻关系的复杂性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">03:33</a> &nbsp;电影中的音乐想表达什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="368">06:08</a> &nbsp;女性成功源于男性的悖论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="464">07:44</a> &nbsp;成功女性和被隐没女性的一致困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a> &nbsp;电影中女主被道德审判的根源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="624">10:24</a> &nbsp;被构建的女性角色/女性是一种处境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a> &nbsp;强势女性的尴尬处境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="754">12:34</a> &nbsp;生产力发展尚未打破性别刻板印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="831">13:51</a> &nbsp;电影中女主对于常规女性形象的打破</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="968">16:08</a> &nbsp;为何人们普遍认为女性更情绪化？男性更理智？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">18:44</a> &nbsp;语言和思维的相互限制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1243">20:43</a> &nbsp;碎片化沟通无法完整传递全面真实想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1354">22:34</a> &nbsp;人们思考模式的先入为主</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1412">23:32</a> &nbsp;成年人更难习得第二语言/被语言塑造的思维模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> &nbsp;影片中女主为何难以为自己辩解？</span></p>]]></description>
