  <item>
    <title>【先导期 | 正在丧失的文化力？窄仄的世界需要纵横的思路】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660c1322c963c276626dc7c4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660c1322c963c276626dc7c4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Apr 2024 14:16:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在社会的多重性维度下，孑然独立还是积极融入、奋斗还是躺平、顺应还是批判，人们有着多重选择和思考。在互联网热闹的探讨中，如何与自我和解、与他人沟通，与社会相处都又仿佛有标准答案。热闹退场后，思考的【预制菜】令人疲惫，我们希望与大家一同在生活中寻找到一方清明，划出思想的乌托邦，寻找更多关于自我、生活、社会、文化未曾开垦的【荒地】。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>花花：忽I忽E | 小丸子与赫敏自主切换 | 飘忽不定</span></p><span></span><p><span>卡拉：E人面具I人真身 | 人类观察员｜被动辩论家</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期要点】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 聆听【只手之音】</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="257">04:17</a> 我们该如何面对文化力丧失？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">04:35</a> 电影《花束般的恋爱》为什么最初灵魂契合的两个人会越走越远？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494">08:14</a> 从更多元的视角看世界</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="521">08:41</a> 关于我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="905">15:05</a> 为什么我们要强调“多元性思考”</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> 群体的过度理性可能不是唯一出路</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1154">19:14</a> 高度信息化的世界里客观是真实存在的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1293">21:33</a> 福柯《疯癫与文明》/感性与理性的界限在哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a> 齐格蒙特·鲍曼对立法者的诠释/立法者与话语权之间的联系问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1493">24:53</a> 丹尼尔·贝尔关于后工业时代和文化关系理论/对物质发展和文明进程的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1616">26:56</a> 女性主义视角也是更加多元化的视角</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1719">28:39</a> 我们期望这档播客能够带给大家(^-^)</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1762">29:22</a> 《只手之音》两周一更，欢迎持续关注！</span></p>]]></description>
